'''Moon''' is the 48th and final [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] stage in all [[Into the Future]] chapters. Like [[Empire of Cats]]' [[Moon (Empire of Cats)/Outbreak|Moon]] before it, all other Into the Future Zombie Outbreak stages must be cleared in a chapter for it to become accessible. The maximum [[Cat Energy|Energy]] will also be increased by 50 each time that it's completed, for a total increase of 150 energy.

